      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Since the smell and symptoms are concerning, your first step should be to contact your local health department to report the odor and potential air quality issue. For immediate relief inside your home, consider running an air purifier with a strong HEPA and activated carbon filter, as carbon is good at absorbing odors. Furthermore, keeping windows tightly closed during the misting cycles will help prevent particulates from drifting inside your bedroom.",
      "source": "target",
