      "content": "Before trying chemical treatments, it is really important to identify the source of the odor, as some hydroponic nutrients or additives can be quite potent. Diffusing strong essential oils might just mask the smell without neutralizing the underlying airborne chemical components. Professional air filtration systems designed for VOC (Volatile Organic Compound) removal, more robust than standard home units, would be a more targeted approach if the issue persists.",
      "source": "target",
